ViridianForest_Text_FriendsItchingToBattle::
    .string "My friends and I are catching BUG\n"
    .string "POKéMON to sell in PEWTER.\p"
    .string "They're itching to battle you.\n"
    .string "Well, your wallet.$"

ViridianForest_Text_RickIntro::
    .string "Hey! You have POKéMON!\n"
    .string "And prize money!\l"
    .string "Let's battle!$"

ViridianForest_Text_RickDefeat::
    .string "No!\n"
    .string "There goes my lunch money!$"

ViridianForest_Text_RickPostBattle::
    .string "Ssh! You'll scare the bugs away.\n"
    .string "Those bugs are my income!$"

ViridianForest_Text_DougIntro::
    .string "Yo!\n"
    .string "Your wallet looks heavy.\l"
    .string "Let me lighten it!$"

ViridianForest_Text_DougDefeat::
    .string "Huh?\n"
    .string "I'm out of POKéMON and money!$"

ViridianForest_Text_DougPostBattle::
    .string "That stinks! I'll have to sell\n"
    .string "my WEEDLE to break even.$"

ViridianForest_Text_SammyIntro::
    .string "Hey, wait up!\n"
    .string "What's the rush? Late on rent?$"

ViridianForest_Text_SammyDefeat::
    .string "I give!\n"
    .string "Take the money!$"

ViridianForest_Text_SammyPostBattle::
    .string "Sometimes you find items on the\n"
    .string "ground.\p"
    .string "Free items! Sell them at a\n"
    .string "POKéMON MART for pure profit!$"

ViridianForest_Text_AnthonyIntro::
    .string "I might be little, but my\n"
    .string "allowance is big!$"

ViridianForest_Text_AnthonyDefeat::
    .string "Oh, boo.\n"
    .string "My allowance!$"

ViridianForest_Text_AnthonyPostBattle::
    .string "I lost my allowance…\n"
    .string "Daddy will just give me more.$"

ViridianForest_Text_CharlieIntro::
    .string "Did you know that evolved POKéMON\n"
    .string "sell for way more?$"

ViridianForest_Text_CharlieDefeat::
    .string "Oh!\n"
    .string "I lost money!$"

ViridianForest_Text_CharliePostBattle::
    .string "BUG POKéMON evolve quickly.\n"
    .string "They're the best quick flip!$"

ViridianForest_Text_RanOutOfPokeBalls::
    .string "I threw POKé BALLS at everything\n"
    .string "and went broke.\p"
    .string "Every ball costs money. Only throw\n"
    .string "at POKéMON worth catching!$"

ViridianForest_Text_AvoidGrassyAreasWhenWeak::
    .string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
    .string "If you can't afford to heal, stay\n"
    .string "out of the tall grass!$"

ViridianForest_Text_UseAntidoteForPoison::
    .string "For poison, use ANTIDOTE!\n"
    .string "Only ¥100 more than last week!$"

ViridianForest_Text_ContactOakViaPCToRatePokedex::
    .string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
    .string "PROF. OAK will evaluate your\n"
    .string "POKéDEX via PC. Fees may apply.$"

ViridianForest_Text_CantCatchOwnedMons::
    .string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
    .string "You can't catch another TRAINER's\n"
    .string "POKéMON. That's theft.\p"
    .string "Buy it from them instead!$"

ViridianForest_Text_WeakenMonsBeforeCapture::
    .string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
    .string "Weaken POKéMON before throwing.\n"
    .string "Missed throws are wasted money!$"

ViridianForest_Text_LeavingViridianForest::
    .string "LEAVING VIRIDIAN FOREST\n"
    .string "PEWTER CITY AHEAD$"

